<title>HONG KONG: Peace Bank of Korea to set US $40 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Peace Bank of Korea to set US $40 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peace Bank Of Korea has mandated KDB Asia to arrange a US $40 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of three years with put and a call options in year two.</p>
<p>Pricing details are not available yet.</p>
<p>The deal has been fully underwritten.</p>
<p>An arranger group is being formed and general syndication is tentatively scheduled to start in early May 1997.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
